{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25796","headline":"忆被牛相留醉州中时无他宾牛公夜出真珠辈数人 · 李绅","name":"忆被牛相留醉州中时无他宾牛公夜出真珠辈数人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"严城画角三声闭，清宴金樽一夕同。\n银烛坐隅听子夜，宝筝筵上起春风。\n酒徵旧对慙衰质，曲换新词感上宫。\n淮海一从云雨散，杳然俱是梦魂中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}